---
config:
  layout: elk
  look: neo
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  title: GUI-24 - Drop box voting bubble chart (required)
  actor User as User

  box Frontend
    participant landingPage as landingPage#58;DOMNode
    participant dropDown as dropDown#58;DOMNode
        participant chart as chart#58;DOMNode
    participant Axios as #58;Axios
  end

  box Backend
    participant Controller as #58;Controller
    participant Service as #58;Service
    participant Repository as #58;Repository
  end
  
  Note right of Repository: IStateDAO in codebase

  Note right of User: Visits state/{fipsCode}
  activate landingPage
  User ->>+ landingPage: Click State

  activate dropDown
  landingPage ->> dropDown: Render
  User ->> dropDown: Click 'Drop Box Voting' tab

  activate chart
  dropDown ->> chart: Render

  Note right of chart: Orval used to generate typesafe request wrappers
  chart ->>+ Axios: getElectionResultsSummary(fipsCode, year=2024)

  Axios ->>+ Controller: GET /state/${fipsCode}/election-year-results/${year}
  Axios ->> Controller: getElectionResultsSummary(fipsCode, year=2024)
  Axios ->> Controller: GET /state/${fipsCode}/${countyFipsCode}/ballot-statistics
  Axios ->> Controller: getBallotStatisticsByCounty(fipsCode, countyFipsCode)

  Note left of Controller: year=2024, is a default query parameter
  Note left of Controller: The Servlet + Jackson Serialization step is omitted for simplicity. <br> The full event flow is in our diagram for GUI-2: Display State
  
  Controller ->>+ Service: getElectionResultsSummary(fipsCode, year=2024)
  Controller ->> Service: getBallotStatisticsByCounty(fipsCode, countyFipsCode)
  Service ->>+ Repository: getElectionResultsSummary(fipsCode, year=2024)
  Service ->> Repository: getBallotStatisticsByCounty(fipsCode, countyFipsCode)
  
  Note left of Repository: Calls into our custom ORM solution, performing row mapping <br> (simplified, full-flow in GUI-2: Display State)
  Repository -->> Service: List<ElectionResultsSummaryModel>
  Repository -->>- Service: BallotStatisticsModel
  
  Service -->> Controller: List<ElectionResultsSummaryModel>
  Service -->>- Controller: BallotStatisticsModel

  Note left of Controller: Serialized into a JSON string
  Controller -->> Axios: HTTP 200 OK: JSONString
  Controller -->>- Axios: HTTP 200 OK: JSONString
  Axios -->> chart: List<ElectionResultsSummaryModel>
  Axios -->>- chart: BallotStatisticsModel
  deactivate chart

  Note left of Axios: Bubble chart data calculated from the server<br>response object and plotted using D3
  Note left of Axios: The political party with the most Presidential election votes in 2024 is determined<br>from the server response object, and each bubble's color is set accordingly
  
  deactivate dropDown
  deactivate landingPage
  